<div class="page-heading"><div class="section-overline">YOUR CAMPUS. YOUR COMMUNITY.</div><h1>A little guide to good finds</h1><p>Pasor Kita brings campus sellers and buyers a little closer.</p></div>
<section class="surface walkthrough" data-walkthrough aria-labelledby="walkthrough-heading"><div class="heading-with-action"><h2 id="walkthrough-heading">From a good find to a happy pickup</h2><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-pause-animation aria-pressed="false">Pause animation</button></div><ol class="walkthrough-steps"><li><span>01</span><h3>Find your thing</h3><p>Browse products and compare categories, prices and campus pickup points.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>A little conversation</h3><p>Ask the seller about availability or condition before placing your order.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Make a pickup plan</h3><p>Order a quantity, suggest a pickup time and wait for the seller to confirm.</p></li><li><span>04</span><h3>Share a little trust</h3><p>Inspect and pay at pickup. After completion, review the item and seller separately.</p></li></ol><p class="quiet-note">All guide steps remain readable when animation is paused or reduced motion is enabled.</p></section>
<div class="help-columns"><section class="surface"><h2>A little room for your ideas</h2><p>List products from your personal profile or a business linked to your account. Add a clear image, an honest description and a public pickup point.</p><a class="primary-button" href="/seller/products/new">Start selling ↗</a></section><section class="surface"><h2>Our campus, our people</h2><p>Use your university email when creating a Pasor Kita account. Email ownership and official university identity verification are separate. SSM and PTU business badges require independent administrator review.</p><p>Pay on pickup, inspect your item and keep your arrangements in the conversation. Ask the administrator to moderate inappropriate listings or reviews.</p></section></div>
